<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" />
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#58cc02" />
  <title>PermisoB · Aprende y aprueba</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@500;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app-shell">
    <aside class="sidebar" aria-label="Navegación principal">
      <div class="brand" data-route="home">
        <div class="brand-mark">P</div>
        <div>
          <strong>PermisoB</strong>
          <span>Aprueba entendiendo</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-list">
        <button class="nav-item active" data-route="home"><span>🏠</span><b>Inicio</b></button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-route="topics"><span>🧭</span><b>Por temas</b></button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-route="simulators"><span>📝</span><b>Simulacros</b></button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-route="mistakes"><span>🎯</span><b>Falladas</b><em id="mistakesBadge">0</em></button>
        <button class="nav-item" data-route="progress"><span>📈</span><b>Progreso</b></button>
      </nav>

      <div class="sidebar-bottom">
        <button class="sync-button" id="syncButton">↻ <span>Sincronizar</span></button>
        <div class="profile-mini">
          <div class="avatar">R</div>
          <div><strong>Permiso B</strong><span id="syncMini">Guardado local</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </aside>

    <main class="main">
      <header class="topbar">
        <div class="mobile-brand"><div class="brand-mark">P</div><strong>PermisoB</strong></div>
        <div class="top-stats">
          <button class="stat-chip" title="Racha"><span>🔥</span><b id="streakTop">0</b></button>
          <button class="stat-chip" title="Puntos"><span>⚡</span><b id="xpTop">0</b></button>
          <button class="stat-chip" title="Corazones"><span>❤️</span><b>5</b></button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <section id="view-home" class="view active">
        <div class="hero-grid">
          <div class="hero-card">
            <div class="eyebrow">TU RUTA AL TEÓRICO</div>
            <h1>Entiende una idea.<br><span>Úsala hasta recordarla.</span></h1>
            <p>El temario convertido en tarjetas fáciles, cuadros e imágenes del manual, preguntas por tema y 88 simulacros.</p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <button class="btn primary" id="continueButton">Continuar</button>
              <button class="btn ghost" data-route="simulators">Hacer simulacro</button>
            </div>
            <div class="today-line"><span>Meta de hoy</span><strong id="dailyText">0 / 20 XP</strong></div>
            <div class="progress-track"><i id="dailyBar"></i></div>
          </div>

          <aside class="right-stack">
            <div class="compact-card streak-card">
              <div class="compact-title"><span>🔥</span><div><strong>Racha</strong><small>Haz algo hoy para mantenerla</small></div><b id="streakCard">0 días</b></div>
              <div class="week-dots" id="weekDots"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="compact-card level-card">
              <div><span class="level-icon">🏁</span><div><small>NIVEL ACTUAL</small><strong id="levelLabel">Empezando</strong></div></div>
              <div class="level-number" id="levelNumber">1</div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>

        <section class="learning-section">
          <div class="section-head">
            <div><span class="section-kicker">RUTA DE APRENDIZAJE</span><h2>Tu camino hacia el aprobado</h2></div>
            <button class="text-button" data-route="topics">Ver los 18 temas →</button>
          </div>

          <div class="path-layout">
            <div class="learning-path" id="learningPath"></div>
            <aside class="path-side">
              <div class="side-card zero-card">
                <span class="side-emoji">🎯</span>
                <h3>Entrenador 0 fallos</h3>
                <p>Practica solo lo que más te cuesta hasta limpiarlo.</p>
                <button class="btn small primary" id="zeroMistakesButton">Entrenar</button>
              </div>
              <div class="side-card test-card">
                <span class="side-emoji">⏱️</span>
                <h3>Simulacro DGT</h3>
                <p>30 preguntas. Como el examen. Resultado al final.</p>
                <button class="btn small dark" data-route="simulators">Empezar</button>
              </div>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>

      <section id="view-topics" class="view">
        <div class="page-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">APRENDE POR BLOQUES</span><h1>18 temas, explicados fácil</h1><p>Cada tema combina teoría visual del manual, trucos para recordarla y todas las preguntas AEOL clasificadas por ese tema.</p></div></div>
        <div class="topics-grid" id="topicsGrid"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="view-simulators" class="view">
        <div class="page-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">MODO EXAMEN</span><h1>88 simulacros AEOL</h1><p>30 preguntas por test. Corrige al final y convierte cada fallo en una regla.</p></div></div>
        <div class="simulator-toolbar">
          <div class="filter-pill active">Todos</div><div class="filter-pill">Pendientes</div><div class="filter-pill">Hechos</div><div class="filter-pill">Aprobados</div>
        </div>
        <div class="sim-grid" id="simGrid"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="view-mistakes" class="view">
        <div class="page-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">REPASO INTELIGENTE</span><h1>Tus preguntas falladas</h1><p>No repitas por repetir: practica justo donde estás perdiendo puntos.</p></div></div>
        <div class="mistake-summary">
          <div><strong id="mistakeCountBig">0</strong><span>falladas pendientes</span></div>
          <button class="btn primary" id="mistakesTrainButton">Practicar falladas</button>
        </div>
        <div id="mistakesList" class="empty-state"><span>🎯</span><h3>Aquí aparecerán tus fallos</h3><p>Cuando falles una pregunta, quedará guardada para repasarla.</p></div>
      </section>

      <section id="view-progress" class="view">
        <div class="page-heading"><div><span class="section-kicker">TU EVOLUCIÓN</span><h1>Progreso y estadísticas</h1><p>Datos locales + estado remoto recuperado desde Turso cuando esté disponible.</p></div></div>
        <div class="stats-grid">
          <div class="metric-card"><span>⚡</span><div><small>XP TOTAL</small><strong id="xpMetric">0</strong></div></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>🔥</span><div><small>RACHA</small><strong id="streakMetric">0 días</strong></div></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>✅</span><div><small>TEST HECHOS</small><strong id="testsMetric">0</strong></div></div>
          <div class="metric-card"><span>🎯</span><div><small>ACIERTO</small><strong id="accuracyMetric">—</strong></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-grid">
          <div class="panel"><h3>Temas</h3><div id="topicProgressList"></div></div>
          <div class="panel sync-panel"><div class="panel-head"><h3>Sincronización</h3><button class="btn tiny ghost" id="syncButton2">Sincronizar ahora</button></div><div id="syncDiagnostics"></div></div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>

  <nav class="mobile-nav">
    <button class="active" data-route="home">🏠<span>Inicio</span></button>
    <button data-route="topics">🧭<span>Temas</span></button>
    <button data-route="simulators">📝<span>Tests</span></button>
    <button data-route="mistakes">🎯<span>Fallos</span></button>
    <button data-route="progress">📈<span>Progreso</span></button>
  </nav>

  <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdrop" hidden>
    <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle">
      <button class="modal-close" id="modalClose" aria-label="Cerrar">×</button>
      <div id="modalContent"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="config.js"></script>
  <script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
